the knowledge base legalrule includes:

the text of the source description is at "sources/LegalRule.ttl".

% Who bears a duty: the agent of this role of the action (lomo.le).
the bearer role is addresser.


norm gdpr art 1 is identified by "http://example.org/Rule_GDPR_Art1".

norm gdpr art 1 is a legal rule.

norm gdpr art 1 has the label "GDPR Subject-matter and objectives".

norm gdpr art 1 has the comment "Scope provision establishing the purpose and scope of the General Data Protection Regulation".

norm gdpr art 1 is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2016/679/art_1".


norm replicated is identified by "http://example.org/Rule_Replicated".

norm replicated is a legal rule.

norm replicated has the label "Replicated compliance rule".

norm replicated has the legal text "The operator shall ensure compliance with the requirements...".

norm replicated is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2018/1148/art_10".

norm replicated is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2023/1234/art_8".


norm open data art 5 is identified by "http://example.org/Rule_OpenData_Art5".

norm open data art 5 is a legal rule.

norm open data art 5 has the label "Open Data Directive Article 5".

norm open data art 5 has the comment "Complex provision combining definitional and procedural elements".

norm open data art 5 is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2019/1024/art_5".


norm e idas art 3 is identified by "http://example.org/Rule_eIDAS_Art3".

norm e idas art 3 is a legal rule.

norm e idas art 3 has the label "eIDAS Definitions".

norm e idas art 3 has the comment "Foundational definitions structuring the eIDAS legal framework".

norm e idas art 3 is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2014/910/art_3".


% The questions of LOMO's requirements document (its competency questions),
% as far as a description can answer them.
query applies is:
    which rule applies to which party.

query rules_without_conditions is:
    which rule has no written conditions.

query places is:
    which rule is laid down in which place.

query kinds is:
    which thing is of the kind which kind.

query rules_of_act is:
    which rule is established by the act which act.

query provisions is:
    which thing is established in which provision.

query legal_texts is:
    which thing has the legal text which text.

query joint_rules is:
    which rule is established in more than one provision.

query prescriptive is:
    which thing is a prescriptive rule.

query constitutive is:
    which thing is a constitutive rule.

query parts is:
    which thing is part of the description.

query texts is:
    which thing is described by the text which text.

query addresses is:
    which thing is identified by which address.

query bearer is:
    the bearer role is which role.

